r how this would work if we are running the client side of a SPA with no server?\n\n\n**Considering Dual Deployment Options**\n\nI\'m now contemplating dual deployment options. I\'m thinking about how the decision guide defines full-stack versus client-side setups, especially API key handling. I\'ve realized a custom `server.ts` would be used in a full-stack deployment. Ideally, this would use Express to serve static files and handle API routes. However, I am now thinking about how to integrate this seamlessly with the Vite development setup.\n\n\n"
