ev server will handle static files in development via a custom plugin, ensuring consistent behavior across environments. This structure keeps things simple, avoiding complex setups or multiple port configurations. I will need to integrate the `@google/genai` SDK on the server-side to generate professional proposals.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I will create `/src/api-handler.ts` containing the backend logic for handling client-customized CRM specs and using the Google GenAI SDK (`gemini-3.5-flash`) to generate a professional CRM Implementation and Architecture Proposal. This logic can be integrated into our Vite dev server config."
