ient data payload. I\'ve broken it down into sections: `clientInfo`, `sections` (covering customer, projects, stages, financials, subsidy, and bank info), and `notes`. Within `sections`, I\'m creating arrays of fields, and options like `pocOption`, `branchOption`, and `includeFinancialStage` to provide user flexibility.\n\n\n"
