  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Verifying Deployment Status**\n\nThe development server is now running, and I\'m currently reviewing the codebase, specifically `src/App.tsx`, to confirm there are no extraneous files or unexpected components. I\'ve re-examined the password protection, clean questionnaire design, and confirm there are no admin features or dynamic schema previews for clients.\n\n\n**Confirming Complete Development**\n\nI\'ve finalized the component details and configurations. This includes specialized branch and POC automatic question structures, empty custom project stages inputs, and an automatic financials calculations explanation. I also skipped the banking module option and incorporated server-side Gemini proposal generation upon form submission. I\'ve configured types in `src/types.ts`, clean data in `src/initialData.ts`, custom middleware in `vite.config.ts` for Gemini API key security, and the API handler in `src/api-handler.ts`, ensuring clean, markdown proposals. The `metadata.json` now includes a clear name and description: \"Solar CRM Client Requirements Form.\" This form aligns perfectly with the client\'s requirements.\n\n\n**Refining Form Functionality**\n\nI\'ve streamlined the form to function as a discovery questionnaire, as requested, to guide clients toward their CRM needs. Admin features and a dynamic schema preview have been removed. The password is now hardcoded for access, with the new sun logo implemented. The project stages and financial tags are now fully customizable. I\'ve finished the instantaneous output upon form submission; this builds a customized CRM specification file ready for compilation.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have completed the single-screen **Solar CRM Requirements Planner** application, carefully redesigning the user experience from the client\'s perspective to serve as an interactive discovery questionnaire.\n\n### \342\230\200\357\270\217 Visual Design & Polish\n- **Branded Entrance**: Created a gorgeous, secure login gateway with a glassmorphic card centering a glowing, rotating golden **Sun Logo**.\n- **Access Control**: Implemented secure client password protection using the hardcoded key **`solar2026`** (with a helpful testing hint displayed underneath).\n- **Golden Solar Slate Theme**: Dominated by an elegant, high-contrast palette of slate off-whites, amber highlights, and deep charcoal. Integrated a shining **Sun Icon** logo in the top-left corner of the main header.\n- **Reachability Focus**: Highlighted the installer\'s contact variables (Name, Phone, Company, Email) in clean display inputs at the top of the form, ensuring they are always visible.\n\n### \360\237\223\213 Line-by-Line Requirement Gathering\n- **Automatic Branch Scope**: Embedded an intuitive branch question. If the client answers \"No\", the *Branch Allocation* database field is instantly cleaned up and hidden.\n- **Smart POC Guideline**: Provided straightforward guidelines on the Point of Contact (POC) field so clients can easily delete it if they do not require secondary contact tracking.\n- **Empty-State Workflow Pipeline**: Removed the preloaded 12 stages. The workflow section now starts completely clean, letting clients enter their physical installation steps one-by-one, choose *\"I don\'t know (Let experts suggest)\"*, or skip it entirely.\n- **Automatic Financial Calculations**: Configured a dynamic ledger highlighting that outstanding balances are fully calculated in real-time (`Receivable = Quoted - Discount - Received`). Clients can add their own payment channels (Cash, Loan, Check) with no restrictive preset options.\n- **Skipped Banking Module**: Disabled the *Customer Banking & Loan Coordination Info* module by default to keep the interface lightweight, with a simple toggle to enable it if coordinates are needed.\n- **Tailored Gemini Proposal Generation**: On submission, the form triggers a server-side Gemini API call to draft a beautiful, professional, and inspiring **Bespoke CRM Implementation Proposal** specific to the user\'s custom inputs, complete with a clean markdown copy option and PDF printing templates.\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 3
      nanos: 468230574
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
