les to make it obvious. The implementation now includes visual feedback for deletion confirmations, incorporating different visual cues.\n\n\n**Defining Field Type Buttons**\n\nI\'m now implementing the buttons for selecting field types. I\'ve created a `labelMap` to handle different labels. I\'m dynamically generating these buttons based on the field type, and I\'ve implemented conditional styling using Tailwind classes to highlight the selected option. It uses the visual styles to signal a selection.\n\n\n**Adding Dropdown Field Details**\n\nI\'m now implementing the details for dropdown fields. I\'ve included a text input for comma-separated options, a clear label, and a helpful tooltip for users. This helps guide users on how to define options for dropdown fields. I\'m focusing on ensuring it\'s clear and user-friendly. I\'m working on the styling, and the overall look and feel.\n\n\n"
